X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//EN"><HTML><BODY><p><strong>Category:</strong> Discount Programs</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> $13 admission for everyone</p><p>Half of the regular $26 adult price; federal employees including military and postal workers free, limit four</p><p><strong>Address:</strong> Oregon Zoo, 4001 SW Canyon Rd, Portland, OR 97221</p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:503-226-1561">503-226-1561</a></p><p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.oregonzoo.org/discounts">https://www.oregonzoo.org/discounts</a></p><p><strong>Details:</strong> Standing $13 income-qualified admission plus the annual Fall Discount Days week, November 3-9, 2026. The November dates came from a search summary of the zoo page - confirm on oregonzoo.org before promoting.</p></BODY></HTML>
